  "desc": "A Volkodlak that has grown extremely powerful by inheriting more of the mighty power in its bloodline.\\nAmong the many different Volkodlaks, those resembling giant elephants or mammoths possess one of the most noble bloodlines. In the past, their clans produced many remarkable warriors, many of whom were even loyal attendants to the King of Beasts.\\nHowever, the greater their individual strength and the longer their lifespans, the harder it is for such fairies to form a community. Compared to other Volkodlaks, this kind is much rarer in present-day Snezhnaya.",
